# Operational gate artifacts (ZAL-617): regenerated by `pnpm gate:operational`
# and pruned at 14-day retention by the same runner. Keeping them out of git
# means the directory can be regenerated from scratch on a clean checkout.
# The directory itself is created by the runner; this pattern matches only
# the runtime JSON files inside it.
/docs/audit/evidence/gates/*.json

